WEBVTT

00:31:29.895 --> 00:31:31.831
for 100 hours a week,

00:31:31.855 --> 00:31:36.053
and it's a combination
of winner takes all,

00:31:36.077 --> 00:31:38.117
hunger of the entrepreneurs,

00:31:38.141 --> 00:31:40.172
the incredible hard work

00:31:40.196 --> 00:31:43.395
and the massive amount
of money being put in.

00:31:43.419 --> 00:31:45.339
And it's very outcome-driven.

00:31:45.363 --> 00:31:48.966
So, no one thinks
that they have to beat the competitor

00:31:48.990 --> 00:31:51.045
on how good an AI algorithm is.

00:31:51.069 --> 00:31:53.236
They just want the final result,

00:31:53.260 --> 00:31:57.466
getting the food to your table
for 70 cents in 30 minutes.

00:31:57.490 --> 00:32:02.855
And that kind of tenacity
just doesn't exist in the US.